<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65652" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέθῠ</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wine</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, only in nom. and acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλὸν . . μέθυ πίνετο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.469
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῖτον καὶ μέθυ ἡδύ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					4.746
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ κριθῶν μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					953
				</span></i>
			, etc.: gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέθυος</span> first in
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Epigr.</u>
				22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				582
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Marc.Sid.
				50
			</span></i>; dat. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέθυϊ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>An.Ox.</u>
					3.255
				</span></i>
			. (Cf. Skt. <i>mádhu</i> 'sweet, sweet drink,
			honey', O<i><span class="en">
				E.
			</span></i>
			<i>medu</i> 'mead', Slav. <i>med[ucaron]</i> 'honey',
		etc.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
